<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 196,276.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 196,276.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of May 30 totaled 196,276 bales compared with 200,154 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 705 bales issued, 1,905 bales awaiting review, 4,583 cancellations, and no decertification orders.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
